# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout for all platforms. Without this,
# Windows checkouts (git core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF, which breaks byte-exact
# comparisons — e.g. the bundled SKILL.md asset vs what `sivru skill install`
# wrote, and any test that asserts on `\n`-joined file contents.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
